p5's public runtime is modified by web/scripts/p5-sandbox.mjs to disable device
motion listeners. Its corresponding source is the p5 version pinned in
pnpm-lock.yaml (https://github.com/processing/p5.js), with that local patch.
D3 and three.js are bundled by web/scripts/build-visual-runtime.mjs.
KaTeX fonts are distributed with KaTeX under its MIT licence. Other reader/UI
fonts are operating-system fonts; no separately vendored font files were found.
Typst bundles Libertinus Serif for PDF export; its font licence is SIL OFL 1.1
(https://github.com/alerque/libertinus/blob/master/OFL.txt), copied unmodified to
web/public/licenses/libertinus.txt.

